# Bookdown
# website: https://bookdown.org/
# docs: https://pkg.yihui.org/bookdown/
# description: Gitignore rules for Bookdown, an open-source R package for authoring books and technical documents with R Markdown.

# Output directory
_book/

# Bookdown auxiliary and intermediate files
_bookdown_files/
_main.Rmd
_main.rds
_main.*

# Knitr and R Markdown rendering cache and temporary files
*_cache/
*_files/
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md